    "description": "This lot includes a variety of collectible rocks, minerals, and gemstones suitable for educational or hobbyist use. It features multiple identification kits with labeled specimens such as limestone, dolomite, gravel, sandstone, slag, shale, gypsum, fluorite, salt, and coal. The collection also contains a range of rough and polished stones in assorted colors and sizes, laminated identification charts, and a Love Pearl kit from St. Augustine, Florida, which includes a sealed oyster and a pendant. Additional items include various polished stones and agate slices. Items are used, with stones stored in plastic bags and some wear evident on packaging and charts. This assortment is appropriate for students, collectors, or individuals interested in geology or gemstones.",
